356
00:28:03,851 --> 00:28:05,085
É importante.

357
00:28:06,153 --> 00:28:07,855
Sim, desculpe.

358
00:28:08,255 --> 00:28:10,191
Está tudo bem.

359
00:28:10,291 --> 00:28:13,427
Ouça, estou me mudando.

360
00:28:18,866 --> 00:28:20,834
